---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with AIStackHub."
>
  <div class="wrap section-head prose" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h1>Contact</h1>

    <p>
      Questions, corrections, or a tool you think we should review? I read every
      message — reach me at
      <a href="mailto:mahmoudsaied7722@gmail.com">mahmoudsaied7722@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Suggest a tool</strong> — tell me the task you want to solve and I'll put it on the test list.</li>
      <li><strong>Report a mistake</strong> — reviews change fast; if something's outdated, I'll fix and re-test it.</li>
      <li><strong>Collaboration</strong> — for partnered reviews and related projects.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>I aim to reply within a couple of days.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>